{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t​一名入境女旅客因管有未完稅香煙和未有向海關人員作出申報，違反《應課稅品條例》在粉嶺裁判法院被判監6星期及罰款1500元。<br/>\r\n　　 <br/>\r\n關員本月10日在落馬洲支線管制站截查一名72歲本地抵港女旅客時，在其身上檢獲961支未完稅香煙，估計市值約4800元。該名女旅客隨即被捕。<br/>\r\n　　 <br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:22:28.849493+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:55:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T17:38:43.342016+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T09:19:08.049004+00:00","content_hash":"5b099ffe271adf17e849bd26e72a24529506c87a62b44c2c40212734508117dd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}